# - led_rdc (GPIO 27) : Light 10W
# - led_etage2 (GPIO 26) : Light 10W
# - led_etage3 (GPIO 14) : Light 10W
# - smoke_sensor (GPIO 32) : Sensor
# - servo_door (GPIO 13) : Actuator 2W
# - buzzer (GPIO 25) : Actuator 0.5W
# 
# FONCTIONNALITÉS AVANCÉES:
# ✅ Energy Metering (mWh/kWh/€)
# ✅ BLE Control (SmartOffice-ESP32)
# ✅ NVS Queue (64 messages offline)
# ✅ WiFi Manager (portail config)
# ✅ Heartbeat automatique (60s)
# ✅ Logs structurés (level/source/message)
# ✅ Diagnostics complets
# ✅ Metrics (reboot count, MQTT stats, etc.)
# 
# ====================================
